OL,3,GNEWSA'Somebody must know' who killed
OL,4,Awoman, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman murdered and
OL,7,Fdumped in a stream on remote moorland
OL,8,Fhave said somebody must know who killed
OL,9,Fher.
OL,11,FVicky Glass vanished from Middlesbrough
OL,12,Fdays after her 21st birthday in 2000 in
OL,13,Fwhat has become a notorious unsolved
OL,14,Fcase.
OL,16,FNow her father and stepdad have spoken
OL,17,Fabout the "soul-destroying" search for
OL,18,Fanswers - 26 years to the day since her
OL,19,Fbody was found.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
