OL,3,GNEWSA'Somebody must know' who killed
OL,4,Awoman, family says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer dad, Tony Glass, said: "It's been
OL,7,F26 years of hell. You can't understand
OL,8,Funless you've been through it, she was
OL,9,Fwiped off the face of the earth, 26
OL,10,Fyears of nothingness. It destroys your
OL,11,Fsoul, it really does."
